@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
participant GridWorld as World
participant "GridActor (saved order)" as Actor
participant NorthshireZone as Zone
participant SaveCodec as Codec
World -> Actor : Shared NPC / summon phase
World -> World : Periodic effects and terminal checkpoints
alt Death, victory or abandoned world
  World -> World : Stop; no remaining arrivals execute
else Active attempt
  World -> World : Regeneration then _arrive_stalker()
  loop Due identity from stalkers_arrived, at most five
    World -> World : Check five gate tiles in stable order
    alt All blocked by terrain, player or living actors
      World -> World : Leave identity pending; stop this retry
      note right of World : Later deadlines stay unchanged.
    else Free gate tile
      World -> Actor : Append gate/stalker/N at free tile
      World -> World : Increment stalkers_arrived
      alt First identity
        World -> Actor : Kill story guard; retain corpse
        World -> World : Announce guard death / feasting
      else Reinforcement
        World -> World : Announce arrival once
      end
    end
  end
  World -> Zone : tick_population(): at most 95 ordinary NPCs
  World -> World : Acquire hostiles; new actors first act next turn
end
note over World, Codec
Revision 5 captures deadlines, entered count, turn and actors.
Load validates identity order; overdue unentered identities remain pending.
Loop reset rebuilds all five deadlines and the living guard.
end note
@enduml
